(text "12 V 20 W solar street light, SC95F8523 version\n\nSheet 1: MPPT charger (sync buck, 100 kHz)\nSheet 2: LED driver (boost, 100 kHz, 12 LEDs at 0.565 A)\nSheet 3: SC95F8523, 10 V and 5 V rails, connectors, NTCs\nSheet 4: gate drivers, current sense, fault comparators\n\nNets connect by global label and power symbol. Generated by generate.py;\nverify.py checks the exported netlist against the design table.\nDesign notes: ../DESIGN.md and ../SC95F8523.md" (at 30.48 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid ceeaaecf-7405-5ac1-a053-9ed2565b8f11))
